ship was over  long before they went public with it in  2021 but it was clear they were on thin  ice back in 2018  jared's absence from brandy's instagram  was obvious to eagle-eyed fans as well  as the media some outlets even spotted  the star without her engagement ring and  cited a few photo ops with new guys not  to be left in the dust jared also went  public with girlfriend rachelle beckman  given the overwhelming evidence of  trouble between the two no one was truly  surprised when brandy finally broke the  news that it was over  season 13 of storage wars brought about  one of the show's biggest switch-ups the  couple formerly known as the young guns  would no longer be working as a team if  anyone thought that meant less drama  they were wrong as jared didn't hesitate  to make things personal brandy bids on  it i'll probably bet during the run up  to the season 13 premiere randy posted a  promo shot on twitter in which jared's  face was fully covered with a devil  emoji i could watch this all day long  for brandy the drama on the show was one  thing in real life however when jared  showed up at a gathering he wasn't  invited to things got physical when he  allegedly shoved brandy multiple times  brandy would go on to claim that similar  incidents contributed to the end of  their decades-long relationship in her  efforts to move forward she even got a  tattoo to symbolize her journey toward  independence jared denied the  allegations but was charged with  domestic battery according to tmz a e  launched an investigation into the  matter and while the findings were never  revealed jared was nowhere to be seen on  the show's 14th season the breakup left  brandy with deep psychological wounds  and she had trouble cultivating her own  identity as a single woman however after  nearly a decade spent living as one half  of a pair brandy is finally taking  control of her own destiny the star  addressed rumors about her relationship  status in february of 2021 and while she  admitted that she's dated a little she's  currently thriving on her own  after the split brandy got primary  custody of the couple's two teens peyton  and cameron while raising them alone  might seem like a big task the star has  admitted that she has been pretty much  doing it herself even when jared was in  the picture as for how she's perfected  her work-life balance she told  mylifetime.com i used to be a  stay-at-home mom and it was very  difficult for me i love my kids but i  felt alienated and depressed when i  didn't have a career so i think i'm a  better parent because i work i'm happier  because of it my mom wants you to shut  your face that's my son cameron even  though she's always glammed up for the  cameras herself brandi has dutifully  protected her kids privacy when they  were younger they were never seen on  social media now that they've grown up  brandi is happy to share the occasional  peek into her family life  storage wars may have netted brandy an  estimated 2 million fortune but the  reality star is happy to give back to  those in need these days she's  advocating for women who have also faced  domestic violence brandy works closely  with the women's own worth organization  as the host of their annual wow apaluza  event in 2019  she helped the charity bring in roughly  100 000 in donations brandi finds her  charity work extremely rewarding as she  told the sailing courier i have  experienced some things in my life and  it's a really wonderful cause i wanted  to help in any way possible check out  one of our newest videos right here plus  even more looper videos about your  favorite reality stars are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one
 

